{"id":7373,"date":"2024-06-25T15:18:24","date_gmt":"2024-06-25T08:18:24","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/?p=7373"},"modified":"2024-06-26T15:10:48","modified_gmt":"2024-06-26T08:10:48","slug":"kehadiran-tlt-pada-perayaan-idul-adha-1445-h-di-pusjarah-tni","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/2024\/06\/kehadiran-tlt-pada-perayaan-idul-adha-1445-h-di-pusjarah-tni\/","title":{"rendered":"Kehadiran TLT pada Perayaan Idul Adha 1445 H di Pusjarah TNI"},"content":{"rendered":"<h2 style=\"font-style:normal;font-weight:600;text-transform:capitalize;\" class=\"wp-block-post-title has-large-font-size\">Kehadiran TLT pada Perayaan Idul Adha 1445 H di Pusjarah TNI<\/h2>\n\n\n<div style=\"height:30px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"><\/div>\n\n\n\n<p>Jakarta, 19 Juni 2024 &#8211; Dalam rangka hari raya Idul Adha 1445 H, Pusat Sejarah Tentara Nasional Indonesia (Pusjarah TNI) melaksanakan penyembelihan hewan kurban di Taman Dirgantara, Museum Satria Mandala, Jakarta.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"text-align: justify;\">PT Telkom Landmark Tower dihadiri oleh Direktur Operasi, Ferry Alfonso melaksanakan penyembelihan hewan kurban yang diselenggarakan oleh Pusjarah TNI dan dipimpin&nbsp; Kapusjarah TNI, Brigjen TNI Rusmili, S.I.P ., M,Si.&nbsp;<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/2-484x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7375\" width=\"242\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/2-484x1024.jpg 484w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/2-142x300.jpg 142w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/2-727x1536.jpg 727w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/2.jpg 757w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 242px) 100vw, 242px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"text-align: justify;\">Hadirnya Direksi Telkom Landmark Tower pada acara penyembelihan hewan kurban Pusjarah TNI, merupakan salah satu bentuk keharmonisan hubungan silaturahmi institusi yang berada dalam satu daerah kawasan.<\/p>\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-image\">\n<figure class=\"aligncenter size-large is-resized\"><img decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"http:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/3-768x1024.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-7376\" width=\"384\" height=\"512\" srcset=\"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/3-768x1024.jpg 768w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/3-225x300.jpg 225w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/3-1152x1536.jpg 1152w, https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-content\/uploads\/2024\/06\/3.jpg 1200w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 384px) 100vw, 384px\" \/><\/figure><\/div>\n\n\n<p class=\"text-align: justify;\">Diketahui terdapat 4 ekor sapi dan 8 ekor kambing yang akan dikurbankan pada pelaksanaan penyembelihan hewan kurban oleh pihak Pusjarah TNI. Setelah penyembelihan hewan kurban dilanjutkan dengan penyebaran daging kepada masyarakat yang berada di lingkungan Pusjarah TNI.<\/p>\n","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Jakarta, 19 Juni 2024 &#8211; Dalam rangka hari raya Idul Adha 1445 H, Pusat Sejarah Tentara Nasional Indonesia (Pusjarah TNI) melaksanakan penyembelihan hewan kurban di Taman Dirgantara, Museum Satria Mandala, Jakarta.&nbsp; PT Telkom Landmark Tower dihadiri oleh Direktur Operasi, Ferry Alfonso melaksanakan penyembelihan hewan kurban&#8230;<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":7374,"comment_status":"closed","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":"","format":"standard","meta":{"_eb_attr":""},"categories":[70],"tags":[],"aioseo_notices":[],"acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7373"}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/post"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=7373"}],"version-history":[{"count":10,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7373\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":7408,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/posts\/7373\/revisions\/7408"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/7374"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=7373"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"category","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/categories?post=7373"},{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/kamadigdev.site\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/tags?post=7373"}],"curies":[{"name":"wp","href":"https:\/\/api.w.org\/{rel}","templated":true}]}}